    {
      "number": 871,
      "text": "Those who believe and do not mix their faith with falsehood[25] are the ones who will be secure, and it is they who are rightly guided.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 6,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنۡعَامِ",
