      "page": 138,
      "ruku": 111,
      "hizbQuarter": 55,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 875,
      "text": "Also Ishmael, Elisha, Jonah, and Lot – each of them We preferred over all other people [of their times].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 6,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنۡعَامِ",
        "englishName": "Al-An'aam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cattle",
        "numberOfAyahs": 165,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 86,
      "juz": 7,
      "manzil": 2,
      "page": 138,
      "ruku": 111,
      "hizbQuarter": 55,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 876,
      "text": "And some of their fathers, their descendants, and their brothers – We chose them and guided them to a straight path.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 6,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنۡعَامِ",
        "englishName": "Al-An'aam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cattle",
        "numberOfAyahs": 165,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 87,
      "juz": 7,
      "manzil": 2,
      "page": 138,
      "ruku": 111,
      "hizbQuarter": 55,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 877,
      "text": "This is Allah’s guidance with which He guides whom He wills of His slaves. If they were to associate others with Him, all their deeds would have been nullified.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 6,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنۡعَامِ",
        "englishName": "Al-An'aam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cattle",
        "numberOfAyahs": 165,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 88,
      "juz": 7,
      "manzil": 2,
      "page": 138,
      "ruku": 111,
      "hizbQuarter": 55,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 878,
      "text": "They are those whom We gave the Scripture, wisdom and prophethood. But if these [pagans] disbelieve in it, then We have entrusted it to a people who will not disbelieve in it.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 6,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنۡعَامِ",
        "englishName": "Al-An'aam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cattle",
        "numberOfAyahs": 165,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 89,
      "juz": 7,
      "manzil": 2,
      "page": 138,
      "ruku": 111,
      "hizbQuarter": 55,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 879,
      "text": "They are those whom Allah has guided, so follow their guidance. Say, “I do not ask you any reward for it. It is but a reminder for the worlds.”",
